   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 427.39,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "再做一次 softmax 形状的池化。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 431.02,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "然后看对角线附近的次邻域占了多少质量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 435.75,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "正常窗口，这条带占大头。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 439.18,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "异常窗口，质量跑出带外。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 442.49,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "最后把池化后的分布，和同一个先验比。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 446.86,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "这就是次邻域版的对称 KL。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 450.49,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "参数只有两个，邻域半宽一，池化半宽五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 455,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "它比关联差异更钝，但召回更高。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 458.92,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "验证段会看到这个取舍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 461.94,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "第三个单元，两阶段焦点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 465.19,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "第一阶段，把窗口压成一个隐向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 469.1,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "第二阶段，用隐向量重建整个窗口。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 473.57,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "重建误差就是分数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 476.3,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "它和普通自编码器的区别在焦点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 480.05,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "焦点是逐点重建误差归一化后的权重。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 484.71,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "误差大的点，权重高。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 487.85,
   "dur": 4.84,
   "speech": "第二阶段的输入不只是隐向量，还带着这份焦点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 492.87,
   "dur": 4.62,
   "speech": "所以它先找哪里难重建，再重点重建那里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 497.67,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "参数两万五千八百九十六个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 501.01,
   "dur": 5.08,
   "speech": "训练四十个 epoch，批大小十六，学习率千分之一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 506.27,
   "dur": 5.94,
   "speech": "梯度用有限差分核对，相对误差 7.75e-11。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 515.61,
   "dur": 2.44,
   "speech": "先把正常看清楚。"
  },
