   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 565.24,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "这一行的权重，几乎全给了尖峰那一个格子。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 569.83,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "行熵掉到 0.000。"
  },
