   "index": 34,
   "start": 799.62,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "原因是单样本梯度噪声太大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 803.11,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "改成批大小十六，同一套超参就稳了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 807.26,
   "dur": 5.03,
   "speech": "损失 0.9536 到 0.0644，单调下降。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 812.47,
   "dur": 4.6,
   "speech": "训练窗口只取每四个里的一个，共二百七十六个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 817.25,
   "dur": 3.52,
