  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 820.95,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "证据程序整体跑 68.9 秒。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 824.74,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "大部分时间，花在这四十轮训练上。"
  },
  {
